<title>UK: FIMAT says Kaye to becomes new CEO from Jan 1997.</title>
<headline>FIMAT says Kaye to becomes new CEO from Jan 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Futures broker FIMAT Group said on Monday that Brian Kaye, the current director of FIMAT in the Americas, would become the new chairman and chief executive officer of the group from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>FIMAT is a subsidiary of Societe Generale.</p>
<p>Kaye will succeed Alain Closier, who has been promoted to executive vice president of the banking services division of Societe Generale in Paris from the same date, FIMAT said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
